          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi bheka, bonke abesifazane abasele endlini yenkosi yakwaJuda bayolethwa ezikhulwini zenkosi yaseBhabhiloni, futhi labo besifazane bayothi: ‘Abangane bakho bakuhlasele futhi bakunqobile; izinyawo zakho zashona odakeni, zabuyela emuva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
